{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SUMMON YOUR STRONGEST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match begins with your summons. They are the heart of your strategy and your key to victory. Each summon has a role: some charge the enemy, others defend lanes, or unleash devastating abilities when deployed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your summons fight independently, but where and when you play them shapes everything. Timing, placement, and coordination determine whether your push succeeds or fails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your summons and watch your strategy come alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/660cc8ad0884b8ade21a13e1dd9a9dd8.poster.avif?t=1762991810\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/660cc8ad0884b8ade21a13e1dd9a9dd8.webm?t=1762991810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/660cc8ad0884b8ade21a13e1dd9a9dd8.mp4?t=1762991810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR DECK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your deck is your game plan. Build a living arsenal of ten summons and three Wildcards that define how you fight. Every card adds possibility: tanks that hold the line, blitzers that dive for the goal, tricksters that disrupt, and Wildcards that buff your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning isn't just about reflexes; it's about building a deck that adapts. Mix aggression with control, coordinate with your teammate's loadout, and evolve your strategy with every match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your deck is your identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/55c7bde751c27c872de02aea79201251.poster.avif?t=1762991810\" width=1170 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/55c7bde751c27c872de02aea79201251.webm?t=1762991810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/55c7bde751c27c872de02aea79201251.mp4?t=1762991810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR CHAMPION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Champion is your presence in the Arena, the fighter who brings your strategy to life. Each Champion has unique abilities that complement your summons, but Wildcard is about teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory comes from synchronizing your Champion\u2019s abilities with your summons\u2019 advances and your partner\u2019s plays. Support the push, protect breakthroughs, and strike when the moment's right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great Champions fight in sync.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/e71388176ba8def1f2490386b8b4edcb.poster.avif?t=1762991810\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/e71388176ba8def1f2490386b8b4edcb.webm?t=1762991810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/e71388176ba8def1f2490386b8b4edcb.mp4?t=1762991810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMPETE IN EPIC ARENAS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into competitive arenas built for high-stakes 2v2 battles. Each layout offers unique challenges from sightlines and elevations to tactical opportunities that reward coordination and map awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work with your teammate to coordinate summons, combos, and positioning. Break through defenses, take down the Goalie, shatter the Shield, and claim that Core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every perfectly timed play brings you closer to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/fd3cbe15919e3887c37ca40d1432c1ab.poster.avif?t=1762991810\" width=1170 height=574 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/fd3cbe15919e3887c37ca40d1432c1ab.webm?t=1762991810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/fd3cbe15919e3887c37ca40d1432c1ab.mp4?t=1762991810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENTER THE ARENA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stage is set, your deck is ready, and your team awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you lead your summons to glory and master your Champion\u2019s potential?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to know is to step into the Arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fame and Glory await the bold.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/6a068a0de18258fba2623a4984108f33.poster.avif?t=1762991810\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/6a068a0de18258fba2623a4984108f33.webm?t=1762991810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/6a068a0de18258fba2623a4984108f33.mp4?t=1762991810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/497120?t=1762991810","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762991810","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/f3ef1685e40a6cd15b9c42d8455884d5b7a57b8a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762991810","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/f3ef1685e40a6cd15b9c42d8455884d5b7a57b8a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762991810","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SUMMON YOUR STRONGEST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match begins with your summons. They are the heart of your strategy and your key to victory. Each summon has a role: some charge the enemy, others defend lanes, or unleash devastating abilities when deployed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your summons fight independently, but where and when you play them shapes everything. Timing, placement, and coordination determine whether your push succeeds or fails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your summons and watch your strategy come alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/660cc8ad0884b8ade21a13e1dd9a9dd8.poster.avif?t=1762991810\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/660cc8ad0884b8ade21a13e1dd9a9dd8.webm?t=1762991810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/660cc8ad0884b8ade21a13e1dd9a9dd8.mp4?t=1762991810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR DECK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your deck is your game plan. Build a living arsenal of ten summons and three Wildcards that define how you fight. Every card adds possibility: tanks that hold the line, blitzers that dive for the goal, tricksters that disrupt, and Wildcards that buff your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning isn't just about reflexes; it's about building a deck that adapts. Mix aggression with control, coordinate with your teammate's loadout, and evolve your strategy with every match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your deck is your identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/55c7bde751c27c872de02aea79201251.poster.avif?t=1762