ns to tactical opportunities that reward coordination and map awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work with your teammate to coordinate summons, combos, and positioning. Break through defenses, take down the Goalie, shatter the Shield, and claim that Core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every perfectly timed play brings you closer to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/fd3cbe15919e3887c37ca40d1432c1ab.poster.avif?t=1762991810\" width=1170 height=574 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/fd3cbe15919e3887c37ca40d1432c1ab.webm?t=1762991810\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/fd3cbe15919e3887c37ca40d1432c1ab.mp4?t=1762991810\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENTER THE ARENA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stage is set, your deck is ready, and your team awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you lead your summons to glory and master your Champion\u2019s potential?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to know is to step into the Arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fame and Glory await the bold.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/6a068a0de18258fba2623a4984108f33.poster.avif?t=1762991810\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto